OL,3,GNEWSAStaffing issues blamed for postal
OL,4,Aservice delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FPostal services in several areas of
OL,7,FCambridgeshire have been delayed
OL,8,Fbecause of staffing issues, Royal Mail
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe postal service said staff shortages
OL,12,Fand sickness were causing ongoing
OL,13,Fissues in Wisbech.
OL,15,FTemporary resourcing challenges were
OL,16,Falso causing delays at other delivery
OL,17,Foffices, including Peterborough, a
OL,18,Fspokesperson added.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
